{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GKWkkZYasUtEdqy7GkQQyT","type":"tool_result","content":"commit e0b0c967e7770022d09ddb5f262816bbbdbebaaa\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Thu Apr 16 00:20:06 2026 +0200\n\n    Pre-allocate WHIR fold buffers with pingpong reuse pattern\n    \n    Pre-allocate one pair of scratch DeviceBuffers at maximum size (1 << m)\n    before the WHIR outer loop and reuse them via std::mem::swap for non-final\n    inner sumcheck rounds (0..k_whir-2). The final inner round still allocates\n    correctly-sized buffers to preserve .len() correctness for\n    w_moments_accumulate.\n    \n    Eliminates 6 VPMM allocations (inner rounds 0-2 of WHIR round 0 at APC 300)\n    and corresponding frees per benchmark run.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n crates/cuda-backend/src/whir.rs | 80 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------\n 1 file changed, 58 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FpUXj5rMDdJzQNh4MtL5WB","session_id":"78bbe79a-49aa-4ea3-b7e0-2913b403757d","uuid":"3cb7b0f6-2831-480a-952b-781b77973761","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:25:33.056Z"}
