{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TDohbWi8etVfe7nccLy9FH","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 8d4718a2851ed06665aaac45a7c5fd2d118a18e9\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Thu Apr 16 00:20:09 2026 +0200\n\n    Revert \"Pre-allocate WHIR fold buffers with pingpong reuse pattern\"\n    \n    This reverts commit e0b0c967e7770022d09ddb5f262816bbbdbebaaa.\n\n crates/cuda-backend/src/whir.rs | 80 ++++++++++++-----------------------------\n 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FpUXj5rMDdJzQNh4MtL5WB","session_id":"78bbe79a-49aa-4ea3-b7e0-2913b403757d","uuid":"ad8c9145-4e22-4d35-ae0c-a2e32cbdd102","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:25:36.021Z"}
