vious related optimizations for context:\n- `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-15-1000-vpmm-bulk-page-creation/report.md`\n- `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-16-0600-tune-vpmm-page-size-for-whir/report.md`\n- `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/report.md`\n\nBe rigorous about whether the optimization mechanism is grounded in evidence or speculative."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3666,"cache_read_input_tokens":234605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3666},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78bbe79a-49aa-4ea3-b7e0-2913b403757d","uuid":"75492a4a-9d9a-4ffb-b3ca-3dcd20b14c4a"}
