{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WHtuAFHPQZdmbY9udvfRLt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! There are environment variables for tuning the GKR PrecomputeM strategy:\n- `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_MIN_N` — threshold below which FoldEval is used (default: 22)\n- `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_MIN_BLOCKS` — minimum blocks threshold (default: 64)\n- `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_TARGET_BLOCKS` — target blocks (default: 1024)\n\n\n- `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_TAIL_TILE` — tail tile size\n- `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M` — enable/disable PrecomputeM entirely\n\nI can run a parameter sweep to see if the current defaults are optimal for APC 300. The critical knob here is `PRECOMPUTE_M_TARGET_BLOCKS`, which indirectly controls the tail tile size and determines how many blocks the M build kernel spawns—more blocks mean better parallelism. For large GKR trees on APC 300, I need to figure out if the M build kernel is becoming a bottleneck.\n\nThere's also `PRECOMPUTE_M_MIN_N` (default: 22) that decides which layers use PrecomputeM versus FoldEval. Some layers might sit just above the threshold but would actually run faster with FoldEval's simpler per-round cost. I should sweep both parameters—`PRECOMPUTE_M_TARGET_BLOCKS` across {512, 1024, 2048, 4096} and `PRECOMPUTE_M_MIN_N` across {18, 20, 22, 24}—then measure APC 300 GKR inner round times to find the sweet spot, and only update defaults if it improves APC 300 without hurting APC 0.\n\nThis could save 10-40ms on GKR inner rounds (currently 213ms) if the defaults aren't tuned for APC 300, and it's a straightforward parameter sweep with medium-high probability of success and minimal complexity.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6297,"cache_read_input_tokens":247706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6297},"output_tokens":38,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78bbe79a-49aa-4ea3-b7e0-2913b403757d","uuid":"18e11d6d-7629-4835-bf44-f8608b5e7ef7"}
